OL,3,GNEWSASuspicious package sent to hotel
OL,4,Acontained explosive device
OL,5,
OL,6,FA suspicious package delivered to a
OL,7,Fhotel in Londonderry contained a
OL,8,F"viable" explosive device, police have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FArmy bomb experts were sent to the
OL,12,Fhotel at Ebrington Square in the city's
OL,13,FWaterside after the package was
OL,14,Fdiscovered at about 15:20 GMT on
OL,15,FTuesday.
OL,17,FThey carried out a controlled explosion
OL,18,Fon the device, which was later taken
OL,19,Faway for a forensic examination.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
